    webdeck: rebrand Chromium -> Arcwel WebDeck
    
    First patch in the WebDeck fork's patch set. Renames the product,
    company, copyright, and macOS bundle id (tech.arcwel.webdeck) so the
    build ships as Arcwel WebDeck rather than Chromium. Verified:
    `--version` reports 'Arcwel WebDeck 153.0.8010.12', app bundle renamed.

